  "prefLabel": "Tra 502.11 Processing of Applications; Enrollment of Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 502.11 Processing of Applications; Enrollment of Projects. The bureau shall process applications for state highway aid in order of receipt. The bureau shall enroll projects based on availability of state aid highway funds.\n\nSource. #8924, eff 6-27-07; ss by #11037, eff 2-22-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra500.html"
